# Workspace-level Markdown. This kit is public and general-purpose; a backlog
# and design drafts name the consumers that asked for each feature, so they
# live in the private skillize umbrella instead of here.
/backlog.md
/drafts/
/docs/
/tasks/

# `.skillize/` needs no rule: it is machine state and carries its own `*`.
# The policy it pairs with is `skillize.yaml` at the root, which is tracked.
